5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3579909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile","html_url":"https://github.com/alice-i-cecile","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alice-i-cecile/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-11-28T21:25:55Z","label":{"name":"A-Windowing","color":"c6a751"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1830860473","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/10784#issuecomment-1830860473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/10784","id":1830860473,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85tILa5","user":{"login":"matiqo15","id":62356462,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzU2NDYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62356462?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15","html_url":"https://github.com/matiqo15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiqo15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-28T22:28:46Z","updated_at":"2023-11-30T14:36:47Z","body":"This issue also affects Fullscreen.\r\n\r\nIf this is not intended, then from what I can see, the easiest fix is to change [`scale_factor_override`](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/main/crates/bevy_window/src/window.rs#L626) in `WindowResolution` to `Some(1.0)`. This would always override `scale_factor` from OS by default. There might be a better approach to this, if using this approach, we should think about adding option to set it to `None`.\r\n\r\nIf this is intended, you can fix it by specifying `resolution` field on `Window`:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nuse bevy::{\r\n    prelude::*,\r\n    window::{WindowMode, WindowResolution},\r\n};\r\n\r\nfn main() {\r\n    let window_resolution = WindowResolution::new(1280.0, 720.0).with_scale_factor_override(1.0);\r\n    App::new()\r\n        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins.set(WindowPlugin {\r\n            primary_window: Some(Window {\r\n                resizable: false,\r\n                position: WindowPosition::Automatic,\r\n                mode: WindowMode::BorderlessFullscreen,\r\n                resolution: window_resolution,\r\n                visible: true,\r\n                ..default()\r\n            }),\r\n            ..default()\r\n        }))\r\n        .run();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere you override scale factor, so it's always going to produce the same resolution.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1830860473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_g